        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of pathogenic HSD3B7 mutations plus abnormal bile acid profile and clinical cholestasis",
    "notes": "Molecular genetic testing is essential for definitive diagnosis."
